{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307120/extras/c222c02bc6d0bae4a62d79b12cdef31f.avif?t=1766765207\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's time to make love happen, again!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kitty Powers\u2019 Matchmaker: Makeover, players step back into the role of a matchmaking agency manager, helping quirky clients find their true love under the expert guidance of the fabulous Kitty Powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This remastered version comes bursting with vibrant new artwork, expanded customization options, and a host of gameplay improvements to make matchmaking even more fun and inclusive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced Artwork: Feast your eyes on Matchmaker\u2019s enhanced assets and sumptuously high definition artwork. Now with 4K and ultra-widescreen modes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expanded Customization: Players have new options to dress and style their characters, with updated personalities and fashion that ensures anything goes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Gameplay Elements: Flex your matchmaking muscles with new dating dilemmas, improved mechanics, and refined controls that make it easier to create perfect matches.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3307120?t=1766765207","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307120/5ec54beb8f9d40f6fca5f7ef879bc4c4891943d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766765207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307120/179ec9b92ccf773ff6fe9163b5998cc41168888c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766765207","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c